  "description": "Non-material amendment to Condition 1 (Approved Plans) of planning permission ref no. 22/AP/3049 (as amended) \"Minor material amendments by variation of Condition 1 'Approved Plans' and Condition 30 'Number of Hotel Bedrooms' of planning permission ref. 20/AP/0556 (Erection of an eight storey building with basement, comprising a hotel (Class C1), flexible commercial or community unit (Class B1/D1), retail floorspace (Class A1/A3), creation of public space, landscaping and associated works. Works to the existing office building at ground and roof levels (including a new rooftop terrace, balustrades and PV panels); elevational alterations; and alterations associated with the creation of a new entrance on the Blackfriars Road elevation).\" The proposed amendments include;\r\rInstallation of a new vertical emergency flue pipe.\rRevised louvred panels for roof plant.\rAmended louvred door changed to solid panels.\rRemoval of vertical green wall from central courtyard design.\rAlteration to ground floor window fenestration to hotel reception, bar and meeting rooms.\rAddition of lift overrun structures extending above the roof line.",
